  ('reading', 'C2', 'mcq', 'customer_service', 'According to the writer, what is the real cause of cases staying open longer?', to_jsonb(ARRAY['An understaffed and incompetent team','A twenty percent drop in ticket volume','Billing disputes needing input from finance','A faulty ticketing system']::text[]), 'Billing disputes needing input from finance', 'The writer explains that ''billing disputes that require input from finance before they can be closed'' are ''inflating the headline figures.''', (SELECT id FROM passage_11)),
